{"id":57,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","X","Yellow"],"text":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It will never forgive opponents who have angered it. Even after it has beaten them down until they can’t move, it never ever forgives."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Some researchers theorize that Primeape remains angry even when inside a Poké Ball."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It has been known to become so angry that it dies as a result. Its face looks peaceful in death, however."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"When Primeape becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"It is always outrageously furious. If it gives chase, it will tenaciously track the target no matter how far."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it catches up."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It will beat up anyone who makes it mad, even if it has to chase them until the end of the world."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Vital Spirit","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is full of vitality, and that prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Anger Point","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is angered when it takes a critical hit, and that maxes its Attack stat."},{"name":"Defiant","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon has any stat lowered by an opposing Pokémon, its Attack stat will be boosted sharply."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"mountain","color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":56,"name":"Mankey","condition":null,"children":[{"id":57,"name":"Primeape","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[{"id":979,"name":"Annihilape","condition":"Use Rage Fist ×20","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[1,116],[1,374],[5,154],[8,67],[15,69],[17,207],[22,238],[26,372],[30,37],[35,889],[39,370],[44,103],[48,707],[53,200],[57,515]],"machine":[512,34,280,339,523,370,174,91,38,409,89,227,283,203,263,7,374,411,264,416,441,270,63,8,808,67,490,118,200,315,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,184,402,421,214,479,180,446,707,444,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,675,87,9,85,369,253,410],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-43","name":"Primeape","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Common","number":"43","artist":"GOSSAN","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-43/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-43/large"},{"id":"sv10-91","name":"Primeape","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Common","number":"91","artist":null,"img":"sv10/91"},{"id":"sv8-99","name":"Primeape","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Common","number":"99","artist":null,"img":"sv8/99"},{"id":"sv4pt5-46","name":"Primeape","set":"Pal